# MUI input refs

Do not use `inputRef` on MUI components (`Checkbox`, `TextField`, `Switch`, `Radio`, etc.). It is deprecated.

Pass the ref through `slotProps.input.ref` instead, including when wiring `react-hook-form` `Controller` fields.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<Checkbox inputRef={field.ref} />
<TextField inputRef={field.ref} />

// ✅ GOOD
<Checkbox slotProps={{ input: { ref: field.ref } }} />
<TextField slotProps={{ input: { ref: field.ref } }} />
```
